## 📝 Content Management

### Create Content
**POST** `/optisigns/content`

Create new content in Optisigns and save reference in Knittt.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Welcome Message",
  "type": "text",
  "content": "Welcome to our office! Please take a seat.",
  "duration": 30,
  "options": {
    "fontSize": "large",
    "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "textColor": "#000000"
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Content created successfully",
  "content": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "tenantId": "1",
    "optisignsId": "content_456",
    "name": "Welcome Message",
    "type": "text",
    "status": "created",
    "createdAt": "2024-12-20T10:30:00Z"
  }
}
```

**Example:**
```bash
curl -X POST "http://34.122.156.88:3001/api/optisigns/content" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN" \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{
  "name": "Welcome Message",
  "type": "text",
  "content": "Welcome to our office!",
  "duration": 30
}'
```

