### Send Content to Displays
**POST** `/optisigns/content/{contentId}/send`

Send specific content to one or more displays.

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "displayIds": ["display_uuid_1", "display_uuid_2"]
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "Content sent to 2 displays successfully",
  "results": [
    {
      "displayId": "display_uuid_1",
      "success": true,
      "response": {...}
    },
    {
      "displayId": "display_uuid_2",
      "success": true,
      "response": {...}
    }
  ]
}
```

**Example:**
```bash
curl -X POST "http://34.122.156.88:3001/api/optisigns/content/your_content_id/send" \
-H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN" \
-H "Content-Type: application/json" \
-d '{
  "displayIds": ["display_uuid_1", "display_uuid_2"]
}'
```

