## 📚 Integration Notes

- **Authentication**: All endpoints require valid JWT token from `/api/login`
- **Rate Limiting**: Optisigns API has rate limits - be mindful of frequent requests
- **Error Handling**: All endpoints return descriptive error messages
- **Data Persistence**: Display and content data is stored in Knittt database
- **Real-time Updates**: Use `/sync` endpoints to refresh data from Optisigns